                "text": "**My Calculation of the Beijing to Tokyo Business Trip Budget**\n\nAlright, let's break this down methodically. My objective is to calculate the total budget in CNY for this business trip from Beijing to Tokyo. I've got the following information: 3 nights, 4 days.\n\nFirst, I see the round-trip airfare is 3200 CNY. That's a straightforward starting point.\n\nNext, I need to convert the Japanese Yen expenses to CNY. The hotel is 18000 JPY per night for 3 nights, totaling 54000 JPY. The daily meal allowance is 6000 JPY for 4 days, which is 24000 JPY.\n\nNow, let's sum up the expenses in JPY: 54000 JPY (accommodation) + 24000 JPY (meals) = 78000 JPY.\n\nThe exchange rate is 0.048 CNY per JPY. So, to convert the JPY expenses to CNY, I multiply: 78000 JPY * 0.048 = 3744 CNY.\n\nFinally, I add the airfare to the converted JPY expenses: 3200 CNY (airfare) + 3744 CNY (JPY expenses) = 6944 CNY.\n\nTherefore, the total estimated budget for this business trip is 6944 CNY. I've double-checked my calculations, and I'm confident in this figure.\n\n\n",
